```java
private void validateDutyRules(String assignee, Instant startAt, Instant endAt, long excludeTaskId) {
    List<TaskSchedule> others = schedules.listActiveByAssignee(assignee).stream()
            .filter(s -> s.taskId() != excludeTaskId).toList();
    // rest rule
    for (TaskSchedule other : others) {
        // gap: positive if non-overlapping
        long gap;
        if (!endAt.isAfter(other.startAt())) { // new ends <= other.start
            gap = Duration.between(endAt, other.startAt()).toMinutes();
        } else if (!other.endAt().isAfter(startAt)) { // other ends <= new start
            gap = Duration.between(other.endAt(), startAt).toMinutes();
        } else {
            gap = -1; // overlap
        }
        if (gap < REST_MINUTES) {
            // date: date of the later interval's start
            Instant laterStart = startAt.isAfter(other.startAt()) ? startAt : other.startAt();
            throw ApiException.unprocessable("SCHEDULE_VIOLATION",
                "人员 " + assignee + " 相邻安排休息不足 " + REST_MINUTES + " 分钟",
                new ScheduleViolationView("REST", laterStart.atOffset(ZoneOffset.UTC).toLocalDate().toString(), REST_MINUTES - gap));
        }
    }
    // daily limit
    Map<LocalDate, Long> perDay = new HashMap<>();
    for (TaskSchedule other : others) addPerDay(perDay, other.startAt(), other.endAt());
    // iterate days of new schedule
    LocalDate day = startAt.atOffset(UTC).toLocalDate();
    LocalDate endDay = endAt.minusNanos(1)...toLocalDate();
    for (d = day; !d.isAfter(endDay); d = d.plusDays(1)) {
        long newMinutes = intersectionMinutes(startAt, endAt, d);
        long total = perDay.getOrDefault(d, 0L) + newMinutes;
        if (total > MAX_DAILY_MINUTES) {
            throw unprocessable(..., new ScheduleViolationView("DAILY_LIMIT", d.toString(), total - MAX_DAILY_MINUTES));
        }
    }
}
```

intersectionMinutes(s, e, day): dayStart = day.atStartOfDay().toInstant(UTC), dayEnd = day.plusDays(1)...; max(s,dayStart) to min(e,dayEnd), minutes.

Note: since intervals are minute-aligned, Duration.toMinutes is exact.

